---

📘 Noun – Important Questions for SSC CGL

✅ Basic MCQs (With Answers)

1. Which of the following is a noun?
a) Run
b) Happy
c) Book
d) Quickly
✅ उत्तर: c) Book


2. Which word is a proper noun?
a) River
b) Ganga
c) Boy
d) City
✅ उत्तर: b) Ganga


3. Identify the common noun:
a) India
b) Rahul
c) Country
d) Ganga
✅ उत्तर: c) Country


4. "Honesty is the best policy." — Identify the noun:
a) is
b) the
c) honesty
d) best
✅ उत्तर: c) honesty (Abstract noun)


5. Which of the following is a collective noun?
a) Soldier
b) Army
c) Fight
d) Brave
✅ उत्तर: b) Army




---

📘 Types Based Questions

6. ‘Love’, ‘Happiness’, ‘Kindness’ किस प्रकार की संज्ञा है?
✅ Abstract Noun


7. ‘India’, ‘Taj Mahal’, ‘Ram’ किस प्रकार की संज्ञा है?
✅ Proper Noun


8. ‘Team’, ‘Crowd’, ‘Family’ किस प्रकार की संज्ञा है?
✅ Collective Noun


9. ‘Pen’, ‘Chair’, ‘Bag’ किस प्रकार की संज्ञा है?
✅ Concrete Noun / Material Noun


10. संज्ञा की कितनी मुख्य श्रेणियाँ होती हैं?
✅ पाँच (5): Proper, Common, Abstract, Collective, Material




---

✍️ Fill in the Blanks

11. He is known for his ___.
a) honest
b) honesty
c) honestly
d) honor
✅ उत्तर: b) honesty


12. A ___ of birds flew away.
a) group
b) bunch
c) flock
d) team
✅ उत्तर: c) flock


13. The ___ of musicians performed on stage.
a) crew
b) troop
c) orchestra
d) class
✅ उत्तर: c) orchestra


14. ___ is a virtue.
a) Truthful
b) Truth
c) Truly
d) True
✅ उत्तर: b) Truth


15. He brought a bag full of ___.
a) rice
b) rices
c) a rice
d) the rice
✅ उत्तर: a) rice (Material noun – uncountable)




---

🔟 One-Liner MCQs

16. ‘Water’ is a ___ noun. → ✅ Material


17. ‘Herd’ is a ___ noun. → ✅ Collective


18. ‘Boy’ is a ___ noun. → ✅ Common


19. ‘India’ is a ___ noun. → ✅ Proper


20. ‘Bravery’ is a ___ noun. → ✅ Abstract




---

💡 Bonus Practice

21. Identify the noun: The sun rises in the east.
✅ sun, east


22. Choose the correct abstract noun of ‘Wise’:
✅ Wisdom


23. Which is a countable noun?
a) Milk
b) Sugar
c) Pen
d) Water
✅ उत्तर: c) Pen


24. ‘The jury has given its verdict.’ — ‘jury’ is a:
✅ Collective noun


25. ‘Happiness’ is the noun form of which adjective?
✅ Happy




